Gold has held value for thousands of years because it's:

→ Scarce
→ Durable
→ Costly to produce
→ Portable
→ Divisible
→ Fungible
→ Transferable

Bitcoin made all 7 digital.

Ethereum Classic keeps all seven and adds an eighth:
→ Programmable

Programmable Digital Gold

